<p class="tagline">A catalogue of Canopy graphs and nodes.</p>
<main>
<h1>hello-graph</h1>
<p class="description">Five nodes with one fail edge, for the drawing test.</p>
<p class="meta"><a href="https://github.com/UniverLab/graphs">UniverLab/graphs</a> — 7 stars</p>
<p><a class="button" href="https://github.com/UniverLab/graphs">Star on GitHub</a></p>
<h2>Install</h2>
<div class="install"><code>canopy graph install hello-graph</code><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="canopy graph install hello-graph" aria-label="Copy the install command to the clipboard">Copy</button></div>
<h2>Drawing</h2><svg class="graph-svg" viewBox="0 0 1062 68" role="img" aria-label="hello-graph: A drawing of the graph: nodes left to right by layer." xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><line class="edge pass" x1="166" y1="34" x2="236" y2="34"></line><line class="edge other" x1="386" y1="34" x2="456" y2="34"></line><line class="edge fail" x1="386" y1="34" x2="16" y2="34"></line><line class="edge pass" x1="606" y1="34" x2="676" y2="34"></line><line class="edge other" x1="826" y1="34" x2="896" y2="34"></line><g class="node kind-agent"><rect x="16" y="16" width="150" height="36" rx="4"></rect><text x="91" y="38" text-anchor="middle">build</text></g><g class="node kind-check"><rect x="236" y="16" width="150" height="36" rx="4"></rect><text x="311" y="38" text-anchor="middle">test</text></g><g class="node kind-gate"><rect x="456" y="16" width="150" height="36" rx="4"></rect><text x="531" y="38" text-anchor="middle">gate</text></g><g class="node kind-router"><rect x="676" y="16" width="150" height="36" rx="4"></rect><text x="751" y="38" text-anchor="middle">triage</text></g><g class="node kind-agent"><rect x="896" y="16" width="150" height="36" rx="4"></rect><text x="971" y="38" text-anchor="middle">docs</text></g></svg>
<h2>Agent nodes</h2><p class="agent-nodes">build, docs</p><p>These agent nodes need a harness to run.</p>
<h2>README</h2>
<div class="readme"><h1>hello-graph</h1>
<p>A graph the page tests render, with **one fail edge**.</p>
<h2>Install</h2>
<pre><code>canopy graph install hello-graph</code></pre>
<p>Read the <a href="https://univerlab.org/canopy/" rel="nofollow">docs</a> and run <code>npm test</code>.</p></div>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer"><a href="https://univerlab.org/canopy/">Canopy · UniverLab</a></footer>
<script>
(function(){document.addEventListener("click",function(event){var target=event.target;if(!target||!target.classList||!target.classList.contains("copy")){return}var command=target.getAttribute("data-copy")||"";if(navigator.clipboard){navigator.clipboard.writeText(command)}var original=target.textContent;target.textContent=command;window.setTimeout(function(){target.textContent=original},1500);});})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
"
`;

